<title>USA: Washington Federal sets 10 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Washington Federal sets 10 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Federal Inc, the parent company of Washington Federal Savings, said Thursday it approved a 10 percent stock dividend to be distributed on February 21.</p>
<p>The dividend to shareholders of record as of February 7 will increase the company's shares outstanding to about 47.5 million from 43.1 million, Washington Federal said.</p>
</text>
